      "id": "2093091358529769913",
      "author_handle": "jumarmacato",
      "created_at": "2026-08-27T21:40:42Z",
      "text": "I then captured an oscilloscope reading of the source signal, dumped it to my computer and have the agent convert it to a OpenEMS phasor to replay it in the sim.",
      "text_en": null,
      "urls": [],
      "media_urls": [],
